<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Lyceum Southern Luzon Inc.</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset & base */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #fff;
      color: #222;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    a {
      color: #004aad; /* Blue */
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    a:hover {
      color: #f2c94c; /* Yellow */
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #004aad, #f2c94c); /* Blue to yellow */
      color: white;
      padding: 1.2rem 2rem;
      position: fixed;
      width: 100%;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    nav .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: white;
    }
    nav ul {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
    }
    nav ul li {
      margin-left: 2rem;
    }
    nav ul li a {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.3rem;
      color: white;
    }
    nav ul li a:hover {
      color: #f2c94c; /* Yellow */
    }
    /* Mobile nav toggle */
    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      cursor: pointer;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .menu-toggle div {
      width: 25px;
      height: 3px;
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section {
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
      background: white;
      min-height: 80vh;
      scroll-margin-top: 80px;
    }
    section:nth-of-type(even) {
      background: #f9f9f9;
    }
    section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #004aad; /* Blue */
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }
    .about-content, .programs-content, .admission-content, .contact-content, .home-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #333;
    }

    /* Home Hero */
    #home {
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550514145-16b498be845e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1350&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
      color: white;
      padding-top: 80px;
      padding-bottom: 80px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    #home::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.7); /* Blue overlay */
      z-index: 0;
    }
    #home .home-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }
    #home h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    }
    #home p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    #home a.button {
      background-color: #f2c94c; /* Yellow */
      color: #222;
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(242, 201, 76, 0.5);
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    #home a.button:hover {
      background-color: #d1a92a;
    }

    /* Program list grid */
    .program-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.8rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .program-item {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      cursor: default;
      border: 2px solid #004aad;
    }
    .program-item:hover {
      transform: translateY(-7px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      border-color: #f2c94c;
    }
    .program-item h3 {
      color: #004aad;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    /* Contact form */
    form {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    input[type="text"],
    input[type="email"],
    textarea {
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: 2px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
      resize: vertical;
    }
    input[type="text"]:focus,
    input[type="email"]:focus,
    textarea:focus {
      border-color: #f2c94c; /* Yellow */
      outline: none;
    }
    button[type="submit"] {
      background-color: #004aad; /* Blue */
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      border-radius: 40px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    button[type="submit"]:hover {
      background-color: #02397a;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background-color: #004aad; /* Blue */
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    /* Back to Top button */
    #backToTopBtn {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 40px;
      right: 40px;
      z-index: 1001;
      background-color: #f2c94c; /* Yellow */
      color: #004aad;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(242, 201, 76, 0.5);
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    #backToTopBtn:hover {
      background-color: #d1a92a;
    }

    /* Responsive Nav */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav ul {
        position: fixed;
        top: 64px;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        background-color: #004aad; /* Blue */
        flex-direction: column;
        display: none;
        padding: 1rem 0;
      }
      nav ul.active {
        display: flex;
      }
      nav ul li {
        margin: 1rem 0;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .menu-toggle {
        display: flex;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
        <img src="logo.png" alt="Image description" style="width: 100px;height: 100px;" title="this is the title of the Image">
      <div class="logo" aria-label="School logo">Lyceum Southern Luzon Inc.</div>
      <div class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Menu" role="button" tabindex="0">
        <div></div>
        <div></div>
        <div></div>
      </div>
      <ul id="nav-list" role="navigation">
        <li><a href="#home" tabindex="0">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about" tabindex="0">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#programs" tabindex="0">Programs</a></li>
        <li><a href="#admission" tabindex="0">Admission</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact" tabindex="0">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="home" role="banner" aria-label="Welcome to Lyceum Southern Luzon Inc.">
  <div class="home-content">
    <h2>Welcome to</h3>
    <h1>Lyceum of Southern Luzon Inc.</h1>
    <h3>Balayan Campus</h3>
    <p>Empowering future leaders through quality education and innovation.</p>
    <a href="#about" class="button" role="button">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" tabindex="0">
  <h2 id="about-heading">About Us</h2>
  <div class="about-content">
    <p>Lyceum Southern Luzon Inc. is a premier institution committed to academic excellence and holistic student development. Established to serve Southern Luzon, we offer a vibrant learning environment with modern facilities, experienced faculty, and a vision to shape future leaders and innovators.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="programs" aria-labelledby="programs-heading" tabindex="0">
  <h2 id="programs-heading">Our Programs</h2>
  <div class="programs-content">
    <div class="program-list" role="list">
      <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Bachelor of Science in Information Systems</h3>
        <p>A Bachelor of Science in Information Systems (BSIS) is a degree program that focuses on the design, development, implementation, and management of computer-based systems and technology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Bachelor of Science in Management Accounting</h3>
        <p>A Bachelor of Science in Management Accounting is a degree program that focuses on the application of accounting principles and practices to support business decision-making.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Bachelor of Science in Customs Admintration</h3>
        <p>A Bachelor of Science in Customs Administration is a degree program that focuses on the study of customs procedures, regulations, and policies.</p>
      </div>
       <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Bachelor of Science in Crimanology (New)</h3>
        <p>A Bachelor of Science in Criminology is a degree program that focuses on the study of crime, criminal behavior, and the criminal justice system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Senior High School (Academic & Technical-Vocational Tracks)</h3>
        <p>Prepare for college or employment with flexible academic and skills-based tracks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-item" role="listitem">
        <h3>Junior High School (Grade7 & Grade10)</h3>
        <p>Junior High School typically refers to the educational level between elementary school and high school, encompassing Grades 7 to 10.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="admission" aria-labelledby="admission-heading" tabindex="0">
  <h2 id="admission-heading">Admission</h2>
  <div class="admission-content">
    <p>Join the Lyceum Southern Luzon Inc. family! Admission is open for all qualified students who aspire to excel and grow in a supportive academic environment.</p>
    <h3>Requirements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Completed application form (available at the school or online)</li>
      <li>Certified true copy of high school diploma or transcript of records</li>
      <li>Birth certificate (NSO/PSA authenticated)</li>
      <li>2x2 ID photos</li>
      <li>Entrance examination or interview (schedule to be announced)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For inquiries about admission schedules and procedures, please contact our Admissions Office.</p>
  </div>
</section>

